<title>USA: Werner names Gregory Werner as president.</title>
<headline>Werner names Gregory Werner as president.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Werner Enterprises Inc, a transportation company, said Thursday it promoted Gregory Werner to the position of president. He was executive vice president.</p>
<p>Werner succeeds Gary Werner, who will continue as vice chairman of the board of directors and continue to work with chairman and chief executive officer C.L. Werner in the strategic planning and direction of the company.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
